number: X
name: The Pulse
path: M1 6 H3 L4 2 L5 10 L6 6 H8 L9 4 L10 6 H11
uprightMeaning: endurance, mending, vigil
reversedMeaning: hollow prolonging, refused rest
tags: season:winter, element:water, gem:topaz, flower:lily
flavor: She has not slept in three days. The pulse is steady because of it.

--- upright
The pulse continues past the point where it should have stopped. The reason is at the bedside. The reason has not slept in days.
---

--- reversed
The pulse is sustained by hands that should have let go. The body is no longer in the breath. The vigil has become the only thing remaining.
---
